ideo class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/50d0346c015224f4a03332ec4a9764ad.poster.avif?t=1764641564\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/50d0346c015224f4a03332ec4a9764ad.webm?t=1764641564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/50d0346c015224f4a03332ec4a9764ad.mp4?t=1764641564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/ab332e37bc3a3215d873b684cca56496.poster.avif?t=1764641564\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/ab332e37bc3a3215d873b684cca56496.webm?t=1764641564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/ab332e37bc3a3215d873b684cca56496.mp4?t=1764641564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>May the best &quot;I” win!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/61002151ca29bc5b343a1925582d5244.poster.avif?t=1764641564\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/61002151ca29bc5b343a1925582d5244.webm?t=1764641564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/61002151ca29bc5b343a1925582d5244.mp4?t=1764641564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
